"TRRF ( Trial Ready Registry Framework ) is a tool for the creation of web-"
"based data entry forms based on reusable data element definitions ( \"Common "
"Data Elements\" ) which can be created and/or loaded into the system at "
"runtime without changes to the source code. TRRF has been forked by QUT's "
"eResearch team from RDRF, that has been developed at the Centre for "
"Comparative Genomics."
