msgid "Caregiver Impact Survey"
msgstr ""

msgid "<b><h4>Survey to Quantify the Impact of Angelman Syndrome from a Caregiver Perspective</h4></b><p>"
"\n<center>Conducted by the Foundation for Angelman Syndrome Therapeutics (FAST) and the Angelman Syndrome Foundation (ASF)<p>"
"\n<b>Module Instructions</center></b><p>"
"\nThis module is estimated to require approximately 30 to 45 minutes to complete and should be completed by:<p><ul>"
"\n<li>•	Individuals who have provided voluntary care or support to a person with Angelman syndrome for ≥ 12 months</li>"
"\n<li>•	Individuals residing in the United States </li>"
"\n<li>•	Individuals familiar with the costs and care for the person with AS over the last 12 months</li></ul><p>"
"\nTo make sure we are not capturing multiple responses for the same household, <b>we ask that only one representative from each household provide responses to this module.</b><p>"
"\n<i>Throughout the survey, we will refer to the person you care for as the “person with Angelman syndrome.\" For the purposes of this study, the PRIMARY caregiver refers to the (non-paid) caregiving person who has the greatest responsibility for the person with Angelman syndrome. A SECONDARY caregiver(s) refers to any other (non-paid) caregiving person(s) in your household who has caregiving responsibility for the person with Angelman syndrome but is not the PRIMARY caregiver. Please do not consider paid professional caregivers as either PRIMARY or SECONDARY caregivers. We are interested in your responses to this survey if you are a PRIMARY or SECONDARY caregiver for a child or adult with Angelman syndrome, even if you are not responsible for the daily physical care of this individual.</i><br>"
"\n<br>"
"\nThe module includes the following sections that you will be asked to complete:"
"\n<table class=\"table\">"
"\n  <tr>"
"\n    <th>Survey Section</th>"
"\n    <th># Questions</th>"
"\n    <th>Est. Minutes</th>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n  <tr>"
"\n    <td>I. Background Information for Person with Angelman Syndrome</td>"
"\n    <td> 7</td>"
"\n    <td> ~3 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n  <tr>"
"\n    <td>II. Background Information for Caregiver</td>"
"\n    <td> 10</td>"
"\n    <td> ~4 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n <tr>"
"\n    <td>III. Impact of Caregiving on Employment / Work Productivity</td>"
"\n    <td> 12</td>"
"\n    <td> ~5 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n <tr>"
"\n    <td>IV. Informal Caregiving for Person with Angelman Syndrome</td>"
"\n    <td> 13</td>"
"\n    <td> ~5 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n <tr>"
"\n    <td>V. Out-of-Pocket Costs</td>"
"\n    <td> 19</td>"
"\n    <td> ~8 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n <tr>"
"\n    <td>VI. Other Sources of Caregiver Impact</td>"
"\n    <td> 8</td>"
"\n    <td> ~3 minutes</td>"
"\n  </tr>"
"\n</table><br>"
"\nWe ask that you do your best to provide answers to all questions in the module. To assist with module completion and estimating costs for you and your family, it may be helpful to review last year’s tax return(s), credit card and/or flexible spending account statements, medical expense records, Individualized Education Program (IEP) forms, and Amazon purchase history. This is not a requirement, and we ask that you please provide your best estimates in your responses.<br>"
msgstr ""
