msgid "<p><b>Instructions:</b></p>"
"\n"
"\n<p>Please answer the following questions about your child/ adult's sleep. Complete this module once when you first join the registry, then every year if your child is 10 years of age or younger, or every 2 years if your child is aged 11 or older. </p>"
"\n"
"\n<p>This module contains the Sleep Disturbance Scale for Children. This questionnaire will allow your Doctor to have a better understanding of the sleep-wake rhythm of your child, and of any problems in his/her sleep behaviour. Try to answer every question; in answering, consider each question as pertaining to the <b> past  six (6) months </b> of the child's life. Please answer the questions by choosing the answer that best applies to your child.</p>"
"\n"
"\n<p><i>Reference: Oliviero Bruni et al</i></p>"
"\n"
"\n<p>This module also includes a sleep diary of your child/adult’s sleep over one week.  You can return to the Registry at any time to complete the diary for subsequent days.</p>"
"\n"
"\n<p>To add a new Sleep Diary entry, please click the 'Add' button. If you wish to delete a Sleep Diary entry, please check the 'mark for deletion' box and click the green 'Save' button.</p>"
"\n"
"\n<p>If you wish, you may print a paper copy of the Sleep Diary<a href=\"https://www.angelmanregistry.info/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/26075919/10.-Sleep-Diary-1-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><b>from this link</b></a></p>."
"\n"
"\n<p><b> Please click the green 'Save' button before progressing to the next Module. </b></p>"
msgstr ""
msgid "At what age did they first sleep through the night, defined as sleeping for at least 6 consecutive hours?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Or,"
msgstr ""

msgid "Has not slept through the night yet"
msgstr ""

msgid "Does your child/ adult have a regular sleeping pattern?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Do you have a modified or special needs bed for sleeping?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Is your child medicated for sleep?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Do you have a camera to monitor your child at night?"
msgstr ""

msgid "<p>This is a validated scale meant for research on sleep issues.  Some of the questions may not be applicable or may be difficult to answer for your loved one.  If you are not sure, please mark \"Don't know\") </p>"
msgstr ""

